# Version 32 recording made before queen kills existed (stream version 33), kept to prove it still decodes unchanged.
# Three spectator stream messages, one per line, each as lowercase hex of its exact payload bytes (before the hub deflates
# and base64-encodes it): a four-colony opening with its full board (version 30), a change message with a queen-bites
# event (version 32), and the full board at that tick (version 32).
# Recorded with the public stream encoder at main 900e46c54b6c1465183736398c18ba0906e4f8c4 (#220), which wrote kill
# totals and queen bites (version 32) but no queen kills. Read by test/live/queen-kills-stream.test.ts.
# Lines starting with # are comments.



